AI-Powered Complaint Management System

A full-stack MERN application that automates complaint management using AI for categorization, priority detection, and real-time status tracking.

Overview

The AI Complaint Management System is a smart grievance redressal platform that allows users to submit complaints with images.
The system analyzes complaints using AI, assigns priority levels, and enables administrators to monitor and resolve issues efficiently.

Key Features

AI-based complaint categorization

Automatic priority detection (High / Normal)

JWT-based secure authentication

Role-based access control (User / Admin)

Image upload support

Real-time complaint tracking

Admin dashboard for monitoring and updates

Tech Stack

Frontend: React (Vite), React Router, Axios
Backend: Node.js, Express.js
Database: MongoDB (Mongoose)
Authentication: JWT
File Upload: Multer
